---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing & Website Services for Therapists | Brighter Sites"
  description="Website design, online launch setup, and ongoing website care for therapists and counseling practices. Website projects start at $1,500."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing & Services</p>

      <h1>A professional web presence without unnecessary complexity.</h1>

      <p class="page-lead">
        Brighter Sites designs, builds, launches, and supports websites for
        therapists and counseling practices. Start with the website itself or
        choose a more complete online launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section founding-offer-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founding-offer">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Founding Practice Program · First 5 practices</p>
          <h2>An introductory rate with 90 days of Managed Growth included.</h2>
          <p>
            The first five qualifying practice clients can start with a
            Professional Website at <strong>$1,250</strong> for the standard
            starting scope instead of $1,500. After launch, the first
            <strong>90 days of Managed Growth</strong> are included at no
            additional cost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="founding-offer-details">
          <div>
            <strong>Professional Website</strong>
            <span>$1,250 founding starting price</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>90 days Managed Growth</strong>
            <span>Three monthly reviews, written reports, and included improvement time</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>No required continuation</strong>
            <span>After 90 days, continue a care plan, switch levels, or stop ongoing service</span>
          </div>
          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Ask about a founding spot</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="founding-fine-print">
        Limited to the first five accepted founding-practice projects. Larger
        scopes, additional pages or services, and third-party purchases remain
        separately quoted. The founding rate applies to the standard
        Professional Website starting scope and does not reduce outside-provider
        charges.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Website packages</p>
        <h2>Start with the level of help your practice needs.</h2>

        <p>
          Every website is custom designed and built. Price changes with scope,
          content depth, integrations, and project complexity—not whether the
          site is custom.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <article class="pricing-card">
          <p class="pricing-label">Professional Website</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">Starting at $1,500</p>

          <p>
            A custom website designed around your practice, services, and the
            experience you want prospective clients to have.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Custom visual design and page layouts</li>
            <li>Responsive mobile, tablet, and desktop development</li>
            <li>Practice, clinician, service, and contact pages as needed</li>
            <li>Search-ready page structure and metadata</li>
            <li>Domain connection and technical launch</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Start a website project</a>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card pricing-card-featured">
          <p class="pricing-label">Complete Online Launch</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$2,000</p>

          <p>
            For a new practice that wants the website and the surrounding
            online foundation handled together.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in the Professional Website package</li>
            <li>Google Workspace setup</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile setup and optimization</li>
            <li>Domain, Cloudflare, and DNS configuration</li>
            <li>Google Search Console and Analytics setup</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Plan my online launch</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="ownership-note">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Your website is separate from ongoing care</p>
          <h3>Support is optional after launch.</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
          Choosing a monthly care plan does not mean repurchasing your website
          every month. If you later stop ongoing service, the paid-for website
          does not need to be purchased again; transition and handoff are
          handled under your service agreement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="third-party-note">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Third-party costs</p>
          <h3>Setup pricing covers our work—not somebody else’s subscription.</h3>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            Unless a written quote specifically says otherwise, the Brighter
            Sites prices shown here cover our labor to set up, configure, and
            connect the service. Purchases and recurring charges from outside
            providers are separate.
          </p>
          <p>
            Examples include domain registration and renewal, additional or
            premium domain names, the Google Workspace plan you choose, and any
            other paid software, phone, email, hosting, or third-party service
            your project requires. If you want several domains—for example the
            same practice name across <strong>.com, .net, and .app</strong>—each
            registration is a separate provider cost.
          </p>
          <p>
            We will identify any required third-party cost before it is
            purchased so you can approve both the service and the expense.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Optional setup services</p>
        <h2>Need help with only part of your online setup?</h2>

        <p>
          These services can be added individually when you do not need the
          complete launch package. The prices below are for Brighter Sites’
          setup and configuration work; third-party purchases and subscriptions
          are separate unless specifically included in your quote.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$250</span>
          <h3>Google Workspace setup</h3>
          <p>
            Business email setup, domain verification, and the essential
            Workspace configuration for your practice. Google’s Workspace
            subscription charge is separate.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$250</span>
          <h3>Google Business Profile</h3>
          <p>
            Setup and optimization of your practice listing so your core
            business information is complete and consistent.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$200</span>
          <h3>Domain, Cloudflare & DNS</h3>
          <p>
            Domain connection, DNS configuration, Cloudflare setup, and the
            technical records needed for your website and email. Domain
            registration and renewal charges are separate.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$150</span>
          <h3>Search Console & Analytics</h3>
          <p>
            Connect the tools needed to understand search visibility and basic
            website traffic after launch.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ongoing website care</p>
        <h2>Choose how much you want us paying attention after launch.</h2>

        <p>
          The three levels are intentionally simple: monitor the essentials,
          maintain the site with you, or actively use the data to improve it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid pricing-grid-three care-grid">
        <article class="pricing-card care-card">
          <p class="care-intent">Monitor</p>
          <p class="pricing-label">Site Monitor</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$29<span>/month</span></p>
          <p class="care-summary">
            For practices that mainly want someone watching the technical basics.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Website uptime monitoring</li>
            <li>SSL and domain checks</li>
            <li>Basic site health monitoring</li>
            <li>Semiannual visual review</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card care-card">
          <p class="care-intent">Maintain</p>
          <p class="pricing-label">Site Care</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$79<span>/month</span></p>
          <p class="care-summary">
            For practices that want regular review plus help with routine changes.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in Site Monitor</li>
            <li>Monthly website review</li>
            <li>Up to 30 minutes of small changes or maintenance</li>
            <li>Routine technical upkeep</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card pricing-card-featured care-card">
          <p class="care-intent">Improve</p>
          <p class="pricing-label">Managed Growth</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$179<span>/month</span></p>

          <p class="care-summary">
            For practices that want a person actively reviewing performance,
            deciding what matters, and making useful improvements.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in Site Care</li>
            <li>Monthly Analytics and Search Console review</li>
            <li>Visitor behavior and conversion-path review</li>
            <li>Monthly written website report with findings, trends, and prioritized recommendations</li>
            <li>SEO, content, and website opportunities prioritized for you</li>
            <li>1–1.5 hours of website work each month to act on findings</li>
            <li>Routine content, CTA, metadata, and small site updates</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="report-note">
            <strong>You receive the findings—not just the monitoring.</strong>
            <p>
              Each month, your report summarizes what changed, what appears to
              be working, what needs attention, and what we recommend improving
              next so you can see what is happening with the site without
              learning an analytics dashboard yourself.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a class="text-link" href="/work/">See how managed website growth works →</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="growth-pricing-panel">
        <div class="growth-pricing-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Managed Growth pricing</p>
          <h3>Stay flexible, or save when you know you want a longer runway.</h3>
          <p>
            Website improvement becomes more useful when we can compare several
            months of search visibility, visitor behavior, and the effect of
            changes made over time. Longer commitments receive a lower effective
            monthly rate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="growth-price-grid">
          <article>
            <p class="growth-price-label">Month to month</p>
            <strong>$179<span>/month</span></strong>
            <p>Maximum flexibility with no annual pricing commitment.</p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <p class="growth-price-label">12-month commitment</p>
            <strong>$159<span>/month</span></strong>
            <p>Billed monthly for 12 months. $1,908 total for the year.</p>
            <small>Save $240 compared with month-to-month pricing.</small>
          </article>

          <article class="growth-price-best">
            <p class="growth-price-label">Annual prepay</p>
            <strong>$1,788<span>/year</span></strong>
            <p>Equivalent to $149/month when the year is paid in advance.</p>
            <small>Save $360 compared with month-to-month pricing.</small>
          </article>
        </div>

        <p class="founding-growth-note">
          <strong>Founding practices:</strong> your first 90 days of Managed
          Growth are included after launch. When that period ends, you can
          continue month to month, choose either annual option, move to another
          care level, or stop ongoing service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-panel">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Additional work</p>
          <h3>Know the price before we start.</h3>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            Additional work is calculated at <strong>$100 per hour in
            15-minute increments</strong>, but that is how we calculate the
            quote—not an open-ended meter.
          </p>
          <p>
            Send us what you want changed. We review the request and give you a
            written price for the defined work. Nothing billable begins until
            you approve it. If the scope changes, we give you a revised quote
            before doing additional work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container service-detail-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What every website includes</p>
        <h2>Built around real practice needs.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-list">
        <div>
          <h3>Clear navigation</h3>
          <p>
            Visitors should be able to understand where they are and find
            important information without hunting for it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Strong mobile experience</h3>
          <p>
            Contact buttons, menus, service information, and calls to action
            remain easy to use on a phone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Thoughtful client pathways</h3>
          <p>
            We make it obvious how someone can learn more, request an
            appointment, or reach the appropriate client portal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Performance and maintainability</h3>
          <p>
            Sites are built to remain fast, understandable, and practical to
            maintain as the practice changes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Have an existing site?</p>
        <h2>You may not need to start from zero.</h2>

        <p>
          We can review an existing therapy website and determine whether a
          focused redesign or a complete rebuild makes more sense.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk about your site</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .founding-offer-section {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .founding-offer {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(39,119,111,.32);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 8%, rgba(95,174,163,.2), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f3ea, white);
  }

  .founding-offer h2 {
    max-width: 17ch;
  }

  .founding-offer > div:first-child > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .founding-offer-details {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .founding-offer-details > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: .25rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .founding-offer-details strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .founding-offer-details span {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: .88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .founding-offer-details .button {
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: .25rem;
  }

  .founding-fine-print {
    max-width: 62rem;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: .8rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .ownership-note,
  .third-party-note,
  .quote-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: #f7faf8;
  }

  .ownership-note h3,
  .third-party-note h3,
  .quote-panel h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
  }

  .ownership-note > p,
  .third-party-note > div:last-child,
  .quote-panel > div:last-child {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .ownership-note .eyebrow,
  .third-party-note .eyebrow,
  .quote-panel .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: .45rem;
  }

  .third-party-note {
    background: #fffdf8;
  }

  .third-party-note p + p,
  .quote-panel p + p {
    margin-top: .85rem;
  }

  .care-grid {
    align-items: start;
  }

  .care-card {
    position: relative;
  }

  .care-intent {
    width: fit-content;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: .35rem .65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--teal-light);
    color: var(--teal-dark);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pricing-card-featured .care-intent {
    background: var(--teal-light);
    color: var(--teal-dark);
  }

  .care-summary {
    margin-top: .8rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: .92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .pricing-card-featured .care-summary {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .report-note {
    margin: 1.35rem 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    border-radius: .9rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .report-note strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: .4rem;
  }

  .report-note p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: .88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .growth-pricing-panel {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: #f7faf8;
  }

  .growth-pricing-intro {
    max-width: 52rem;
  }

  .growth-pricing-intro h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
  }

  .growth-pricing-intro > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin-top: .7rem;
  }

  .growth-price-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .growth-price-grid article {
    padding: 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: white;
  }

  .growth-price-best {
    border-color: rgba(39,119,111,.38) !important;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(216,235,230,.55), white 70%) !important;
  }

  .growth-price-label {
    margin-bottom: .5rem;
    color: var(--teal-dark);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .growth-price-grid strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .growth-price-grid strong span {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  .growth-price-grid article > p:not(.growth-price-label) {
    margin-top: .65rem;
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: .88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .growth-price-grid small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: .65rem;
    color: var(--teal-dark);
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .founding-growth-note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.15rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .quote-panel {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    background: white;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .ownership-note,
    .third-party-note,
    .quote-panel {
      grid-template-columns: .7fr 1.3fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .growth-price-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 58rem) {
    .founding-offer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>